      "flags": {},
      "order": 6,
      "mode": 0,
      "showAdvanced": null,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "How to use",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "LoRA Prober Compare: every LoRA in the list renders the same prompts and seeds; the node shows the likeness summary and a sheet per seed, and writes a flip-book video that steps through the files (output/lora_prober/compare_*).\n1. Pick your model files in the loaders. Do NOT add a LoRA to the model.\n2. loras: one entry per line. A part of a name picks every matching file (all saves of a run); runs keep the order of the lines, saves of a run go in step order. '| 0.8' sets a strength, '| 8-23:mlp' keeps only some layers.\n3. Reference photos give likeness scores (optional).\n4. Queue. Renders are shared with LoRA Prober's cache: what LoRA Prober already rendered at the same settings is not rendered again."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "LoRA Prober Compare: every LoRA in the list renders the same prompts and seeds; the node shows the likeness summary and a sheet per seed, and writes a flip-book video that steps through the files (output/lora_prober/compare_*).\n1. Pick your model files in the loaders. Do NOT add a LoRA to the model.\n2. loras: one entry per line. A part of a name picks every matching file (all saves of a run); runs keep the order of the lines, saves of a run go in step order. '| 0.8' sets a strength, '| 8-23:mlp' keeps only some layers.\n3. Reference photos give likeness scores (optional).\n4. Queue. Renders are shared with LoRA Prober's cache: what LoRA Prober already rendered at the same settings is not rendered again."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
